---
import Pagina from '../../layouts/Pagina.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../../site.config.mjs';
import { u } from '../../lib/util';
---

<Pagina titulo="Privacy policy" descricao={`What data ${SITE.nome} uses, why, and how you control it.`} alternativa={{ pt: u('/politica-de-privacidade/') }}>
  <p>Last updated: November 22, 2026.</p>

  <h2>What the site collects on its own</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing that identifies you. There are no accounts, comments or forms that send us data. We store only two things on your device: your
    console choice (PS5 or Xbox) in the cheats table and your last 5 searches on the site. They never leave your browser, and what you type
    in the search box is not sent to us. To delete your searches, use the "Clear" button in the search itself.
  </p>

  <h2>Google ads</h2>
  <p>
    The site shows ads through Google AdSense. Google and its partners use cookies and identifiers to show ads based on your visits to this and
    other sites, and to measure how those ads perform.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>You can turn off personalized ads at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">adssettings.google.com</a>.</li>
    <li>Learn how Google uses data from partner sites at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Visit statistics (Google Analytics)</h2>
  <p>
    We use Google Analytics to count how many people visit the site, which pages are read most and where visits come from (search, social media,
    direct). It uses cookies and receives data such as device type, browser and approximate region. We do not use this data to identify anyone.
    You can block it with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics opt-out add-on</a>
    or in your browser's cookie settings.
  </p>
  <p>
    For visitors in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom and Switzerland, Analytics only uses cookies with consent. When your browser
    reports a European time zone, it is not loaded at all until consent is given or Google reports that the rule does not apply. If you refuse,
    it stays off and its cookies on this site are deleted.
  </p>

  <h2>YouTube videos</h2>
  <p>
    Videos only load when you click to watch, and they use YouTube's privacy-enhanced mode (youtube-nocookie.com). From that click on, YouTube's
    privacy rules apply.
  </p>

  <h2>Fonts and hosting</h2>
  <p>
    Fonts come from Google Fonts and pages are delivered by a hosting service. Like any website, these services receive your device's IP address
    in order to deliver the content.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask for information about, correction of, or deletion of any personal data we hold about you. Since the site stores no personal data,
    in practice this applies to messages you send through the <a href={u('/en/contact/')}>contact page</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>If anything changes, this page is updated and the date at the top changes too.</p>
</Pagina>
